253|## Coordinate System
254|
255|Three.js uses a **right-handed coordinate system**:
256|
257|- **+X** points right
258|- **+Y** points up
259|- **+Z** points toward viewer (out of screen)
260|
261|```javascript
262|// Axes helper
263|const axesHelper = new THREE.AxesHelper(5);
264|scene.add(axesHelper); // Red=X, Green=Y, Blue=Z
265|```
