349|### Euler
350|
351|```javascript
352|const euler = new THREE.Euler(x, y, z, "XYZ"); // Order matters!
353|euler.setFromQuaternion(q);
354|euler.setFromRotationMatrix(m);
355|
356|// Rotation orders: 'XYZ', 'YXZ', 'ZXY', 'XZY', 'YZX', 'ZYX'
357|```
