260|## Skeletal Animation
261|
262|### Skeleton and Bones
263|
264|```javascript
265|// Access skeleton from skinned mesh
266|const skinnedMesh = model.getObjectByProperty("type", "SkinnedMesh");
267|const skeleton = skinnedMesh.skeleton;
268|
269|// Access bones
270|skeleton.bones.forEach((bone) => {
271|  console.log(bone.name, bone.position, bone.rotation);
272|});
273|
